{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear conditions, uses short directed turns for side/front obstacles, allows one brief backward escape only from a dedicated front-obstacle recovery path, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated repeated-failure state. Action states are one-shot, and uncontrollable events are total in every specification state.",
